      "traits": [
        "occult",
        "water"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The sodden sentinel vomits up a supernaturally tainted wave of seawater in a 30 foot cone. Each living creature in the area takes <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">6d10</span> void damage (DC 30 basic Reflex save). It can't use Seawater Retch again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
